3. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL  -  NOT relicensed by this repository
================================================================================
The frozen datasets in version2/data/ are aggregate allele and genotype counts
retrieved from the Ensembl REST API for the 1000 Genomes Project phase 3
reference panel. They remain subject to the terms of their originating projects
and are redistributed here only as aggregate counts with recorded provenance
and digests. Nothing in sections 1 and 2 above grants any right over them.

No third-party figures are reproduced anywhere in this repository. Works cited
in the manuscripts are cited only, which this licence does not extend to.
